# target/ is several GB of Rust build artifacts. The Dockerfile copies only
# Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, irc.defaults.toml, src/ and dxr/, and BuildKit
# transfers just what a COPY
# references -- but excluding it here keeps that guarantee from depending on the
# Dockerfile staying selective.
target/
dxr/target/

.git/
.github/
.idea/
*.md
logs_of_last_ci_run/
